WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.100
Click Kanban in the toolbar

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.600
A column for each status

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.100
Drag a card to another column

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.600
It's In Progress now

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.100
Or right-click a card › Move To

6
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:24.700
…Move To…

7
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.600
…any status

8
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:39.100
…and there it is, in Done
